{"id":"esfuerzo","lemma":"esfuerzo","pos":"noun","rank":1437,"glosses":["effort, endeavor"],"ipa":"/esˈfweɾθo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"esfuerzos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-esfuerzo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sin esfuerzo no se consigue nada.","en":"No pain, no gain.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442942","words":[{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to achieve","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"nothing"}]},{"text":"Su éxito depende de sus esfuerzos.","en":"His success depends on his efforts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687729","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"success"},{"g":"to depend","l":"depender"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Gracias por el esfuerzo.","en":"Thanks for the effort.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460837","words":[{"g":"thank you, thanks"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Mis esfuerzos no dieron ningún resultado.","en":"My efforts produced no results.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null,{"g":"result"}]},{"text":"Debes dar tu mejor esfuerzo.","en":"You must do your best.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to give, to give out"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"better"},null]}]}